{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Soul is a breath of fresh air for competitive fighters. Every battle will test your skill, cunning, and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master  the elements as a spiritual warrior in fast, responsive fights. Attack and defend with Water, Earth, Fire, and Air; choose wisely because each one has a strength and a weakness. Water beats Fire. Fire beats Air. Air beats Earth. Earth beats Water. Combine different elements to discover new elements like Lightning, Ice, and Lava, to name a few.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy PVP or PVE using a variety of characters that each have their own abilities and playstyles. As you progress through the game, customize your combat style by unlocking new skills and attacks for each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete online with the world's best fighters in Ranked Play. Ranking up unlocks rewards like new skins and accessories for your characters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892890?t=1755625165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892890?t=1755625165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892890/3abb3e95fa9b60e7d2cfa0f8fa08aa5a89754ab1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755625165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892890/3abb3e95fa9b60e7d2cfa0f8fa08aa5a89754ab1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755625165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Soul is a breath of fresh air for competitive fighters. Every battle will test your skill, cunning, and resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master  the elements as a spiritual warrior in fast, responsive fights. Attack and defend with Water, Earth, Fire, and Air; choose wisely because each one has a strength and a weakness. Water beats Fire. Fire beats Air. Air beats Earth. Earth beats Water. Combine different elements to discover new elements like Lightning, Ice, and Lava, to name a few.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy PVP or PVE using a variety of characters that each have their own abilities and playstyles. As you progress through the game, customize your combat style by unlocking new skills and attacks for each character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete online with the world's best fighters in Ranked Play. Ranking up unlocks rewards like new skins and accessories for your characters.</p>","developers":["Sennin"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892890/7034a9727034022eafbd6c89041b9896e01e0b85/header.jpg?t=1755625165","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892890/1483646068/f1d37642dbe5f68201ae04faa427c7d64c6b0371/1755573857/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755625164","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3892890/1483646068/f1d37642dbe5f68201ae04faa427c7d64c6b0371/1755573857/dash_h264.mpd?t=